  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kunzwana Energy for Horticulture Entrepreneurship Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kunzwana Women&apos;s Association will launch a solar-powered irrigated produce farm in Zvevahera village including a 6 hectare garden, a borehole, a warehouse, and cold storage facilities to reduce post harvest losses. At least 300 farmers will benefit including 180 women, and farmers will receive agricultural training and linkages to markets.</narrative>
  </description>
